<title>USA: Hughes Supply completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said on Monday that it completed its acquisition of JuNo Industries Inc and its affiliate J.I. Services Corp.</p>
<p>The company described the September 16 transaction as stock-for-stock, which will be accounted for using the pooling-of-interests method of accounting.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be accretive to earnings per share for the year, it added. Hughes Supply did not reveal the details of the transaction.</p>
<p>In August, it said it would acquire the companies for an undisclosed number of shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>JuNo and J.I. are distributors of industrial supplies and equipment with headquarters in Lakeland, Florida.</p>
